# No Inline Styles

Inline styles (`style={{...}}`) are forbidden in application code. Visual styles must be managed via design tokens and components in `packages/design-system/`.

## Why
Ensures visual consistency and allows for central theme management.

## Examples
// ❌ BAD
<div style={{ color: 'red', marginTop: '10px' }}>Error</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<Typography variant="error" className="mt-2">Error</Typography>
